WEBVTT

00:23:28.264 --> 00:23:30.800
for your life, like,
I don't know what to tell you.

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.862
You know? You don't
watch "Bourne Identity"

00:23:32.862 --> 00:23:37.106
and go drive your car
over a gondola in Venice. (Laughter)

00:23:37.736 --> 00:23:40.672
Well, yeah, okay, like, if you're
a little kid or whatever,

00:23:40.672 --> 00:23:42.876
of course it's different, but --

00:23:42.876 --> 00:23:46.570
Yeah, all right, I remember
one thing like that.

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:50.480
I was at this kid's house
one time playing GTA,

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:52.510
uh, Grand Theft Auto?

00:23:53.417 --> 00:23:56.123
Dude, are you from Canada? (Laughter)

00:23:57.593 --> 00:24:00.986
So, like, whatever, with Grand Theft Auto,